Why this licence: Terminal-wide's design derives from the Terminal skin, which
derives from LateNight by jus, Owen Williams and ronso0, licensed CC BY-SA 3.0
Unported. That obligation carries forward here.

The layout is original. It takes its touch sizing and its tabbed page model as
reference from Pioneered by Sven Boekelder (GPL-3.0) but carries none of its
markup, so no GPL-3.0 obligation attaches.

The icons under Terminal-wide/library/ are Mixxx's own sidebar icons, flattened
and repainted. Mixxx is GPL-2.0-or-later; see the Mixxx project for the terms
that cover them.

The files under patches/ are changes to Mixxx itself and carry Mixxx's licence
(GPL-2.0-or-later), not this one.
